  "solution": {
    "text": "Moles of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>So from the balanced chemical equation, moles of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math>  moles of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo></math>  moles of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>So moles of polythene  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>So weight of polythene  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> kg <br/><br/>= 28 kg",
